# The Ultimate Doom E4M9 (M9): started beside line 1622 (special 11, tag 0), on its
# front, the player uses it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e4m9-line1622).
iwad doom
map E4M9
exit normal
start 160 2432 90

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0 x2
0 0 0 2
